        "text_gPmPmK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Channel International Enterprises took its first step in the year 2009, under its primary appellation Channel International Audio Supply. Principal address #380 Jacinto Quezon Avenue Quezon City. After a year, the company transferred from a very little elbow room of 40 sq. m. to its present post of 250 sq. m. located at 43 Don Alejandro Roces Avenue, Brgy. Paligsahan, Quezon City (across Amoranto Sports Complex, in the same building as the biggest recording studio in the Philippines - Asiatec Pinknoise). Toiling away and ploughing the ground were four individuals that gradually worked their way up with one vision.</p><p></p><p>The number of employees has trebled at a rate of knots as it has successfully become a complete source for multi-media equipment needs as well as the Philippines’ first and only online store under its trade name channel.com.ph. From a handful of products, Channel expanded beyond 4,000 commendable merchandise, 100 outstanding brands, and 250 categories in sound, video, broadcast, lights, CCTV, and Power &tools.</p><p>Channel supplies products and services not only to online shoppers and offline consumers but also to churches, universities, schools, hospitals, rental companies, broadcasting companies, and government agencies. Its services include installation, rental, and studio recording, mixing, mastering, and shooting.<br/><br/>With its long years of experience in a broadcast facility, Channel is always ready to provide the people with the necessary equipment, services, and access to better and more reliable information, helping them be able to keep up with the demands of the time.</p>"
